{"id":"ae36177506103af2","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set.md","title":"ZFC Poset Fixed Point Set","display":"df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set — ZFC Poset Fixed Point Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set — ZFC Poset Fixed Point Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set — ZFC Poset Fixed Point Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,f,P,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(F,f,P,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetFixedPointSet}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetFixedPointSet}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetFixedPointSet}_S(F,f,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,P)\\land F=\\{p\\in P:f(p)=p\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetFixedPointSet}_S(F,f,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,P)\\land F=\\{p\\in P:f(p)=p\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The fixed-point set is relative to an explicit endomap; the order is retained because downstream fixed-point theorems impose monotonicity or completeness conditions on this poset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-order]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-order]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,f,P,\\leq_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Order}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetFixedPointSet}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPosetFixedPointSet}_S(F,f,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,P)\\land F=\\{p\\in P:f(p)=p\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1028,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set.md|58-df-zfc-poset-fixed-point-set]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","2aa29158e60b337f"]}